sk systems, the cost of non-compliance (legal/financial) far outweighs the few hours spent in a design review.\n\n    *   Rationale: Integrating logging into the core architecture prevents technical debt and avoids the high risk/cost of retrofitting complex traceability requirements into finished systems. While it adds a step to the sprint process, it ensures that compliance is technically viable from day one.\n    *   Decision: approve.\n    *   Promise: 90 (Very strong because it's a sound engineering principle for regulated environments).",
