c (prediction) with the auditing logic (logging).\n    *   Does it help prototype faster? No, it slows it down.\n    *   Is it viable? Technically possible, but architecturally unsound and brittle.\n\n    *   Rationale: Integrating regulatory logging directly into model architectures creates unnecessary coupling between inference and infrastructure, which will severely degrade prototyping speed and system flexibility compared to standard middleware logging.\n    *   Decision: reject.\n    *   Promise: low (maybe 20-30 because it's \"innovative\" in a research sense, but as a Dev Engineer focused on viability/speed, it's a nightmare).",
