rd-keeping (Article 12). Doing them separately is wasteful.\n    *   Integrating these into a single pipeline maximizes the value of the data being collected.\n    *   Automating reports reduces the administrative burden on researchers, allowing them to focus back on scientific ambition.\n\n    *   Rationale: Integrating mandated logging with post-market monitoring prevents redundant effort and transforms a regulatory burden into an automated operational asset, optimizing our long-term compliance costs.\n    *   Decision: approve.\n    *   Promise: 85 (High, because it's pragmatic and addresses multiple regulatory requirements simultaneously, though not \"100\" as the complexity of real-time streaming can sometimes lead to scope creep).",
