sk AI aims to achieve.\n\n    *   Rationale: This proposal aligns with the post-market monitoring requirements of Article 12(2)(b) while enhancing institutional reputation through scientific leadership; however, strict anonymization protocols must be maintained to avoid GDPR conflicts.\n    *   Decision: approve.\n    *   Promise: 85 (High value, moderate risk if publication isn't carefully vetted).",
